Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 01:32:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 145/254] fix(tools): unbreak qwen35 run_reference import under
 by-path loading

task=fix-q2-tools-relative-import
base=port/pypto-x-integration @ c2ec98f3ccc8a6b8419a7a75abb2790cd62456b1

The W8G portability test loads tools/qwen35_reference/run_reference.py via
importlib.spec_from_file_location: the directory is not on sys.path and the
module has no parent package, so the sibling import added by C8/Q2 (c2ec98f3c)
and its `from . import` fallback both fail with ImportError.

- run_reference.py: when loaded without a package (script / by file path),
  prepend the module directory to sys.path before the sibling import; package
  imports keep the relative-import fallback.  No gold/quant semantics touched.
- test_qwen35_portability_overrides.py: the no-torch loader stub now provides
  the bfloat16/float32 attributes that w8a8_reference.W8A8_VARIANTS reads at
  import time; assertions and coverage are unchanged.
